OL,3,GNEWSAReport highlights rural public
OL,4,Ahealth inequalities
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in rural towns and villages are
OL,7,Ffacing unique public health challenges,
OL,8,Fwith community and voluntary groups
OL,9,Fcentral to tackling the problem, a
OL,10,Freport has said.
OL,12,FPublished by Oxfordshire County
OL,13,FCouncil, it said this was due to a
OL,14,Frange of issues, including poor
OL,15,Ftransport connections, high living
OL,16,Fcosts and a lack of local services.
OL,18,FThe report said older people were
OL,19,Fgenerally worse affected, although
OL,20,Fareas like Faringdon have specific
OL,21,Fchallenges facing children and young
OL,22,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
